    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>護甲（中甲），非普通（需同調）</em><br />穿着這套護甲期間，你可以用其施展法術<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.o9GQEt4fYw6WjpB0]{死者交談 Speak with Dead}</em>或是<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.xYpJGRI4xcMa41kO]{活化死屍 Animate Dead}</em>。以此施展了法術後，直到次日黎明爲止這套護甲都無法再次被用於施展這兩個法術。<br />這套盔甲會隨着你靈魂的離去而消逝。若你在同調這套護甲期間死亡，這套護甲也將隨之摧毀。</p><p><span style=\"font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif\">釘刺甲是一種罕見的中甲，它們出自矮人工匠之手，造型看上去像是覆蓋了金屬尖刺的皮革外套和護腿。</span></p><p>While wearing this armor, you can use it to cast either @spell[Speak with Dead] or @spell[Animate Dead]. Once the armor has cast a spell in this way, it can't cast either spell until the next dawn.</p><p>Your soul keeps this armor together. If you die while you are attuned to the armor, the armor is destroyed.</p><p>Spiked armor is a rare type of medium armor made by dwarves. It consists of a leather coat and leggings covered with spikes that are usually made of metal.</p></div>",
